{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261023/photo/bkn-20261023161245049-1023_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261023163444\"/><p>一名男子在觀塘鯉魚門道猥褻露體。</p><p>執法部門於上周四(15日)接獲報案，指懷疑一名男子分別在同日及9月21日，在觀塘鯉魚門道猥褻露體。警員經深入調查後，前晚(21日)於油塘油麗邨拘捕一名26歲本地男子，他已被暫控4項「猥褻暴露身體」罪，案件將於明日(24日)上午在觀塘裁判法院提堂。.</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.342330+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:12:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:20.928846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:21.055930+00:00","content_hash":"2eb1b00d3b56895c4f47651ebe238a84e2112cb84e445bcc667107c772923c33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.342330+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}